✨ What's New in ANU 7?
📦 All-New Next-Gen File System Format
ANU 7 introduces an entirely redesigned, high-throughput compressed filesystem architecture.
To deploy this massive performance leap, the installation process will fully format existing legacy storage volumes,
ensuring a clean, ultra-fast initialization of core elements.
🔒 Hardened Safe Configuration Mode (SCM)
Ultimate control, protected by strict privilege architecture.
SCM is now fully restricted to prevent unauthorized environment modifications.
You must explicitly root the system to unlock and pass security gates before gaining access to safe recovery environments. 
🎨 Dynamic Responsive UI & OOBE
Experience a beautiful, interactive Out-of-Box Setup. Dynamic button styling,
automated localized alignment settings,
and a fully polished modern theme adapt instantly to your verified privilege parameters.
📁 Dynamic Registry Handling
Your user preferences, themes, and application state metrics are now safely written to isolated style registries (.reg),providing unmatched consistency across boot cycles.
